{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0217","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:000000f4:text","row":29937,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"荷物を置きに教室に。","en":"To the classroom to drop off my things.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00001","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00001"],"en":"I drop off my bags in the classroom.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00097","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:000000f4:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:00000128:text","row":29938,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「おや？」","en":"“Oh?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00002","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00002"],"en":"Taichi: \"Well?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-cross-script-alias-group:00098","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:00000128:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:0000014a:text","row":29939,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"冬子の姿がない。","en":"Touko isn't there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02252","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00003","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00003"],"en":"Touko's nowhere to be seen.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02252","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:0000014a:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:00000172:text","row":29940,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"来ていると思ったのに。","en":"I thought she'd be here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00155","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00004","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00004"],"en":"But I thought she was coming.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00155","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:00000172:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese says the speaker expected the person already to be present or to have come; the progressive English changes that state.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":18,"text":"was coming"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:000001a0:text","row":29941,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"いつもの窓際。","en":"Her usual place by the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01029","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00005","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00005"],"en":"That window seat of always.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01029","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:000001a0:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:00000297:text","row":29942,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"そこにお嬢様の姿はない。","en":"No sign of the young lady there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00186","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00006","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00006"],"en":"Ojou-sama's figure was not there.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00186","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:00000297:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:000002c7:text","row":29943,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"胸騒ぎがした。","en":"Unease stirs in my chest.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01179","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00007","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00007"],"en":"I felt vaguely at unease.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01179","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:000002c7:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese expresses a premonitory unease; the English is malformed and weakens the bodily apprehension.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":25,"start":0,"text":"I felt vaguely at unease."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:000002ed:text","row":29944,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"いつもと違う行動を取らないでくれ。","en":"Don't do anything out of the ordinary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00928","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00008","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00008"],"en":"Never take actions different from the always.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","idiom_calque"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00928","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:000002ed:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese asks the person not to act differently from usual; the English phrase 'different from the always' is not grammatical English.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":45,"start":0,"text":"Never take actions different from the always."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:00000327:text","row":29945,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"願いにも似た思い。","en":"A thought almost like a prayer.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00214","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00009","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0038a:00009"],"en":"A thought that resembled a wish.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00214","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0217:00000327:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:00000351:text","row":29946,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"ズタ袋を置いて、学校を彷徨(さまよ)う。","en":"I set down my gunny sack and roam the school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:0000038f:text","row":29947,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"はじまって三日目の『いつも』。","en":"“Usual,” only three days into its existence.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0217:000003c5:text","row":29948,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"けど実際は、幾度めなのだろう。","en":"But how many times has it really been?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
